Upstream work: milsymbol.js (MIT)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This crate is a native Rust port of milsymbol.js by Måns Beckman
(https://github.com/spatialillusions/milsymbol), version 3.0.4, commit
b05f2d7cbadb0845ca637d346a2d7d8163ab59cb.

The composition logic in src/ is a translation of the upstream JavaScript, and
the tables in src/generated/ are mechanically extracted from the upstream
source by tools/codegen. Both are derivative works of milsymbol.js, which is
distributed under the MIT License:

    Copyright (c) 2017 Måns Beckman - www.spatialillusions.com

The full upstream license text is reproduced in LICENSE-MIT-milsymbol and must
be retained in all copies or substantial portions of this software. The MIT
License permits relicensing of the derivative work; the port as a whole is
distributed under AGPL-3.0-or-later, while the upstream MIT notice continues to
apply to the upstream-originated portions.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Other references
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

milsymbol-py (https://github.com/klundeen/milsymbol-py, MIT) was consulted only
for the composition of its 109,216-symbol reference corpus. No code or data from
milsymbol-py is included; this repository's corpus is generated independently
from the pinned upstream JavaScript by tools/oracle.
